---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Projects | Steve Weiler"
  description="Desktop, infrastructure, AI, and automation projects by Steve Weiler."
>
<main>

    <section class="page-header">
        <h1>Projects</h1>
        <p>A selection of desktop, infrastructure, and automation projects.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cards">

        <article class="card project-card">
            <div class="project-header">
                <div class="project-badge">FD</div>
                <div>
                    <h2><a class="project-title-link" href="/focaldesk/">FocalDesk</a></h2>
                    <p class="project-kicker">Wayland desktop environment</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <a class="project-visual project-visual--focaldesk project-visual-link" href="/focaldesk/" aria-label="Read the FocalDesk case study">
                <img
                    class="project-visual-image project-visual-image--contain"
                    src="/images/focaldesk-screenshot.png"
                    alt="FocalDesk desktop environment screenshot"
                >
            </a>

            <p>
                A modern Wayland desktop environment written in Rust featuring a
                compositor, native applications, HDR support, encrypted credential
                storage, and AI integration.
            </p>

            <p><strong>Technologies:</strong> Rust, Wayland, Smithay, OpenGL ES</p>

            <div class="actions">
                <a class="button" href="/focaldesk/">Read case study</a>
                <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/sjweiler/focaldesk">GitHub</a>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card project-card">
            <div class="project-header">
                <div class="project-badge">FA</div>
                <div>
                    <h2><a class="project-title-link" href="/focal-agent/">Focal Agent</a></h2>
                    <p class="project-kicker">Local-first Windows AI assistant</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <a class="project-visual project-visual--focal-agent project-visual-link" href="/focal-agent/" aria-label="Read the Focal Agent case study">
                <div class="visual-assistant">
                    <div class="visual-assistant-shell">
                        <div class="visual-assistant-top">
                            <span class="visual-terminal-dot dot-red"></span>
                            <span class="visual-terminal-dot dot-yellow"></span>
                            <span class="visual-terminal-dot dot-green"></span>
                            <span class="visual-assistant-title">assistant.log</span>
                            <span class="visual-terminal-badge">Active</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="visual-assistant-body">
                            <div class="visual-assistant-chips">
                                <span>Desktop</span>
                                <span>Voice</span>
                                <span>Plugins</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="visual-assistant-thread">
                                <div class="assistant-message assistant-message--user">What is running on this PC?</div>
                                <div class="assistant-message assistant-message--agent">The Inventory plugin needs permission to inspect processes.</div>
                                <div class="assistant-message assistant-message--result">Permission required · Review request</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>

            <p>
                Windows desktop assistant with local Ollama chat, offline Vosk voice
                input, and permission-gated external plugins.
            </p>

            <p><strong>Technologies:</strong> C#, .NET 10, WinForms, Ollama, Vosk</p>

            <div class="actions">
                <a class="button" href="/focal-agent/">Read case study</a>
                <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/sjweiler/focal-agent">GitHub</a>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card project-card">
            <div class="project-header">
                <div class="project-badge">IA</div>
                <div>
                    <h2><a class="project-title-link" href="/focal-agent-inventory/">Focal Agent Inventory Plugin</a></h2>
                    <p class="project-kicker">Read-only Windows inventory plugin</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <a class="project-visual project-visual--infra project-visual-link" href="/focal-agent-inventory/" aria-label="Read the Focal Agent Inventory Plugin case study">
                <div class="visual-terminal">
                    <div class="visual-terminal-shell">
                        <div class="visual-terminal-top">
                            <span class="visual-terminal-dot dot-red"></span>
                            <span class="visual-terminal-dot dot-yellow"></span>
                            <span class="visual-terminal-dot dot-green"></span>
                            <span class="visual-terminal-title">inventory.json</span>
                            <span class="visual-terminal-badge">Go</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="visual-terminal-body">
                            <div class="visual-terminal-command">&gt; focal-agent-inventory.exe inventory.collect</div>
                            <div class="visual-terminal-json">
                                <div><span class="json-key">hostname</span><span class="json-sep">:</span> <span class="json-string">"DESKTOP-12345"</span></div>
                                <div><span class="json-key">os</span><span class="json-sep">:</span> <span class="json-string">"Windows 11"</span></div>
                                <div><span class="json-key">arch</span><span class="json-sep">:</span> <span class="json-string">"amd64"</span></div>
                                <div><span class="json-key">cpu_count</span><span class="json-sep">:</span> <span class="json-number">32</span></div>
                                <div class="json-indent"><span class="json-key">memory_total_gb</span><span class="json-sep">:</span> <span class="json-number">64</span></div>
                                <div><span class="json-brace">&#125;</span></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>

            <p>
                Read-only Windows plugin that gives Focal Agent structured system,
                disk, network, process, and service inventory over JSON.
            </p>

            <p><strong>Technologies:</strong> Go, gopsutil, Windows SCM, JSON</p>

            <div class="actions">
                <a class="button" href="/focal-agent-inventory/">Read case study</a>
                <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/sjweiler/focal-agent-inventory-plugin">GitHub</a>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card project-card">
            <div class="project-header">
                <div class="project-badge">FV</div>
                <div>
                    <h2><a class="project-title-link" href="/focalvector/">FocalVector</a></h2>
                    <p class="project-kicker">Low-latency vector database</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <a
                class="project-visual project-visual--vector project-visual-link"
                href="/focalvector/"
                role="img"
                aria-label="Read the FocalVector case study"
            >
                <div class="vector-architecture">
                    <div class="vector-flow">
                        <span class="vector-node vector-node--client">Client</span>
                        <span class="vector-connector">HTTP / local IPC</span>
                        <span class="vector-node vector-node--router">Collection router</span>
                        <div class="vector-branches">
                            <div>
                                <span class="vector-node">Query executor</span>
                                <span class="vector-detail">HNSW + metadata</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <span class="vector-node">Write coordinator</span>
                                <span class="vector-detail">WAL + memtable</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="vector-database" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 88 112">
                            <ellipse cx="44" cy="20" rx="32" ry="12"></ellipse>
                            <path d="M12 20v24c0 6.6 14.3 12 32 12s32-5.4 32-12V20"></path>
                            <path d="M12 44v24c0 6.6 14.3 12 32 12s32-5.4 32-12V44"></path>
                            <path d="M12 68v24c0 6.6 14.3 12 32 12s32-5.4 32-12V68"></path>
                        </svg>
                        <strong>Vectors</strong>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>

            <p>
                Durable Rust vector database with exact and HNSW search, metadata
                filtering, WAL-backed persistence, sharding, and replication.
            </p>

            <p><strong>Technologies:</strong> Rust, HNSW, OpenRaft, CRC32C</p>

            <div class="actions">
                <a class="button" href="/focalvector/">Read case study</a>
                <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/sjweiler/focal-vector">GitHub</a>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card project-card">
            <div class="project-header">
                <div class="project-badge">FC</div>
                <div>
                    <h2><a class="project-title-link" href="/focal-control-center/">Focal Control Center</a></h2>
                    <p class="project-kicker">FocalDesk administration and diagnostics</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <a class="project-visual project-visual--control-center project-visual-link" href="/focal-control-center/" aria-label="Read the Focal Control Center case study">
                <img
                    class="project-visual-image project-visual-image--contain"
                    src="/images/focal-control-center-overview.png"
                    alt="Focal Control Center dashboard showing system health, resource usage, sessions, displays, and services"
                >
            </a>

            <p>
                Browser-based administration and diagnostics console with live FocalDesk
                system, service, session, display, GPU, and log telemetry.
            </p>

            <p><strong>Technologies:</strong> React, Node.js, Express, Server-Sent Events</p>

            <div class="actions">
                <a class="button" href="/focal-control-center/">Read case study</a>
                <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/sjweiler/focaldesk-control-center">GitHub</a>
            </div>
        </article>

    </section>

    <section class="card cta-strip">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">What these demonstrate</p>
            <h2>Systems engineering, product thinking, and software delivery.</h2>
            <p>
                The common thread is practical engineering: useful tools, clean boundaries,
                thoughtful interfaces, and reliable automation.
            </p>
        </div>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/contact/">Contact Me</a>
    </section>

</main>
</BaseLayout>
